    "No reviewer model call.",
    "No runtime/live server, browser automation, target workspace command or mutation.",
    "No database, CI/blocker, git branch/stage/commit/push/PR, release/deploy/publish or active automation action.",
    "No raw prompt/stdout/stderr/provider payload retention in repo."
